1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,300
Tus fotos pueden espantar ventas…

2
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:05,500
se arreglan con tu celular.

3
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:07,900
Uno: luz de ventana.

4
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:10,300
De lado a la ventana…

5
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:12,700
apaga las demás luces.

6
00:00:13,250 --> 00:00:15,100
Dos: fondo simple.

7
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:17,600
Cartulina blanca doblada en curva…

8
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:20,100
sin esquinas ni distracciones.

9
00:00:20,650 --> 00:00:23,300
Tres: limpia la lente.

10
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:27,000
lente sucia, foto borrosa.

11
00:00:27,550 --> 00:00:30,000
Cuatro: nada de zoom digital.

12
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,400
Mejor acércate tú…

13
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:35,000
o tu cámara de 2×–3×.

14
00:00:35,550 --> 00:00:38,500
Cinco: tres ángulos por producto:

15
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:40,300
de frente, de lado…

16
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:41,800
y un detalle.

17
00:00:42,350 --> 00:00:45,000
Edita poco: brillo y nitidez.

18
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,300
Que se vea real.

19
00:00:47,850 --> 00:00:49,400
Comenta la palabra…

20
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:52,600
FOTO

21
00:00:52,650 --> 00:00:54,600
Te mando una lista

22
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:56,600
de tomas profesionales.

23
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:58,400
Síguenos en Atlas Path.
